# Full first-flight logging. LOG_BITMASK 830 was a LOWERED value; 894 adds the
# bits that make a drift or oscillation diagnosable after the fact (IMU, RCIN,
# RCOUT, ATTITUDE_FAST). Put it back to 830 once the aircraft is trimmed and
# flying, since the APM 2.8's dataflash is small and 894 fills it faster.
LOG_BITMASK 894
